---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Replica copies a DROP TABLE; the earlier backup keeps the table. Times are illustrative.
---
<figure class="rf">
  <div class="rf-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 330" role="img" aria-label="A client drops the orders table on the leader. The leader sends the same change to the follower, which also loses the table. A backup taken earlier, at 03:00, is the only copy that still has it.">
    <rect x="20" y="70" width="150" height="84" rx="4" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="laptop" x={152} y={70} size={26} />
    <text x="95" y="106" text-anchor="middle" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Client</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Client</tspan></text>
    <text x="95" y="128" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>drops a table</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>xoá một bảng</tspan></text>
    <line x1="172.0" y1="112.0" x2="279.0" y2="112.0" class="edge " /><polygon points="288.0,112.0 279.0,107.5 279.0,116.5" class="head " />
    <text x="230" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">1. DROP TABLE</text>
    <rect x="290" y="70" width="190" height="84" rx="4" class="box bad" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={462} y={70} size={26} />
    <text x="385" y="106" text-anchor="middle" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Leader</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Leader</tspan></text>
    <text x="385" y="128" text-anchor="middle" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>orders table: gone</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bảng orders: mất</tspan></text>
    <line x1="482.0" y1="112.0" x2="639.0" y2="112.0" class="edge " /><polygon points="648.0,112.0 639.0,107.5 639.0,116.5" class="head " />
    <text x="565" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>2. same change</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2. cùng thay đổi</tspan></text>
    <rect x="650" y="70" width="230" height="84" rx="4" class="box bad" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={862} y={70} size={26} />
    <text x="765" y="106" text-anchor="middle" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Follower</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Follower</tspan></text>
    <text x="765" y="128" text-anchor="middle" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>3. applies it: gone too</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>3. áp dụng: cũng mất</tspan></text>
    <line x1="385.0" y1="156.0" x2="385.0" y2="217.0" class="edge dash" /><polygon points="385.0,226.0 389.5,217.0 380.5,217.0" class="head dash" />
    <text x="399" y="196" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>snapshot taken earlier, before the mistake</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>snapshot chụp từ trước, trước lỗi</tspan></text>
    <rect x="290" y="228" width="190" height="84" rx="4" class="box ok" />
    <DiagramIcon name="backup" x={462} y={228} size={26} />
    <text x="385" y="264" text-anchor="middle" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Backup, 03:00</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Backup, 03:00</tspan></text>
    <text x="385" y="286" text-anchor="middle" class="t-ok"><tspan data-lang-en>orders: still there</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>orders: vẫn còn</tspan></text>
    <text x="510" y="262" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Only the backup can bring the table back.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ backup mới đưa được bảng quay lại.</tspan></text>
    <text x="510" y="282" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>The replica already lost it.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Replica đã mất nó rồi.</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The follower is a faithful copy, mistakes included. The backup is older on purpose, and that is what saves you.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Follower là một bản sao trung thành, kể cả lỗi. Backup cố ý là bản cũ hơn, và chính điều đó mới cứu được bạn.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .rf { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .rf-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .rf svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .rf text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .rf .t-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-hs { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-b { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .t-mono { font-size: 12px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-bad { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .t-ok { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .rf .box.strong { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.empty { fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .rf .box.bad.empty { fill: none; }
  .rf .edge { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .rf .edge.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.ok { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .head.bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .rf .head.ok { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .rf figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
